   "alt": "A sunny walled garden with a stone fountain in the middle and five painted doors in the garden wall: red, yellow, green, blue and purple. A dog lounges on a cushion gnawing a bone, a girl on a stool laughs at a bee on a string, a hiker sets off with a big bun under his arm, and a girl waves to the old gardener pushing his wheelbarrow. Through the iron gate on the left a girl drives off in a red pedal car past a boy with a paper; by the fountain a fisher boy, a toy tugboat, a waiter with buns and a girl at a doll's bed. The iron gate at the top left leads out to the village square."
